# packages/contracts — canonical contracts

Owners: Platform Core team (identity: @nexora/platform-core)

Scope: this package is the single source of truth for all cross-module
contracts. Every domain, platform module, application, plugin, and AI agent
depends on these types.

Rules:
- No duplicate contract definitions anywhere else in the repository.
- Type-only package: do NOT add runtime dependencies. The `guards` module is
  the sole runtime surface (dependency-free type guards); keep it that way.
- Runtime constant VALUES (e.g. `ErrorCode`, `SideEffectClass`) live in
  `@nexora/shared`; contracts declares the canonical TYPE surface.
- Contract changes require a compatibility review (versioning module).
